{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only singleprofile model using pca_n2000 encoder, achieving validation accuracy of 0.4849 and F1 of 0.4639, lower than some RNA-only configurations. The result suggests potential limitations of the pca_n2000 encoder or singleprofile setting, but the exact contribution of these factors remains uncertain without direct comparison to alternative encoder or profile settings. The impact of multiprofile benefits versus encoder quality is still unclear."
}

